media: i2c: imx471: prepare own-handset factory mode candidate

Add verified mode records and firmware-gated link-frequency selection.
Retain the legacy preview and expose digital compose geometry.
Full-resolution quad RAW requires explicit experiment opt-in; full RGB
remosaic is unfinished.
This candidate is not installed and does not claim mode timing acceptance.

